# Broadcom-WL Kernel 6.18 Porting Guide

## Core Mission
Maintain and patch the Broadcom STA driver for modern XanMod kernels (6.18+).

## Technical Stack
- **Compiler:** Clang 19 / LLD
- **Kernel Target:** 6.18.18-x64v2-xanmod1
- **Base Source:** https://github.com/antoineco/broadcom-wl

## Known Architectural Shifts (Kernel 6.18)
1. **Timer API:** Replace \`init_timer\` and \`timer.data\` with \`timer_setup()\` and \`from_timer()\`.
2. **Header Moves:** Use \`<linux/unaligned.h>\` instead of \`<asm/unaligned.h>\`.
3. **ProcFS:** \`PDE_DATA\` is now lowercase \`pde_data\`.
4. **Missing Symbols:** \`strlcpy\` is gone; use \`strscpy\` or the local static inline implementation.

## Build Command
\`make CC=clang -C /lib/modules/\$(uname -r)/build M=\$(pwd)\`